      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID60",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "You were provisionally allocated $8. The other participant was provisionally allocated $4. We now...",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">You were provisionally allocated <b>$8</b>. The other participant was provisionally allocated <b>$4</b>.</span><br><br></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">We now present four hypothetical final allocations of the task you carried out. We ask you to describe a real-world situation you find each similar to.&nbsp;The situation can involve two people or groups. It can be an experience you or somebody you know lived, or it could be fictional. Remember that the task was:<br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">You can transfer any amount between -$4 and $8.  If you choose a negative dollar transfer to the other participant, this means that you take that amount&nbsp;<i>from the other participant</i>.<br><br>The hypothetical allocations are:</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</div>",
